In Sarla Verma & Ors. Vs. Delhi Transport Corporation & Anr.3, this Court has laid down as under:
"16."Just compensation" is adequate compensation which is fair and equitable, on the facts and circumstances of the case, to make good the loss RICHA RICHA MANCHANDA MANCHANDA Date: 2025.12.24 14:12:34 +0530 MACP No. 729/22;
FIR No. 108/21; PS. Alipur DOD:24.12.2025 suffered as a result of the wrong, as far as money can do so, by applying the well settled principles relating to award of compensation.
